Z||000008||DaRkLoRD||07-27-2000||01:39 AM||||thanks everyone.. I sorta guessed most of that already, but it's nice to hear that some other people can't figure out girls either..<P>to be fair, yes.. I was slightly interested in raven.. to the extent that I thought she's very attractive, and a nice person.. and if she were 3-5 years older... she'd probably make a really good girlfriend.. (not for me though... I'm not her type..)<P>but... since she's not 3-5 years older... I figured.. nice to look at, but too young for me.. I wasn't trying to pick her up, or hit on her, etc. (either of them)<P>anyway, I still feel pretty crappy...<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
